Pursuant to the General Data Protection Regulation (EU) 2016/679, I am exercising the following data subject rights:

1. Right of Access (Article 15)
I request confirmation of whether you are processing personal data concerning me. If so, please provide:
- The purposes of the processing
- The categories of personal data concerned
- The recipients or categories of recipients to whom the data have been or will be disclosed
- The envisaged storage period, or the criteria used to determine it
- The source of any data not collected directly from me
- Information about any automated decision-making, including profiling, and the logic involved

2. Right to Erasure (Article 17)
I request deletion of all personal data concerning me that you hold.

3. Right to Object — Direct Marketing (Article 21(2))
I object to any processing of my personal data for direct marketing purposes. Per Article 21(3), you are required to cease such processing upon receipt of this objection.

Per Article 12(3), you are required to respond to this request without undue delay and within one calendar month of receipt. If you require an extension under Article 12(3), you must notify me within that initial month with reasons for the delay.

Per Article 12(5), this request must be fulfilled free of charge.

If you require additional information to verify my identity, please specify exactly what is needed. I will provide reasonable verification.

Please confirm completion of these requests in writing.
